            <div xml:id="d171-a1">

                <pb facs="0348" n="278" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg278"/>

                <head>Remarks to the President upon presenting letter of credence.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to present to you this
                    letter, accrediting me as minister resident of the United States. The President
                    directed me to assure you of the continued friendship and good will of the
                    people of the United States toward the republic of Costa Rica. It will be the
                    constant effort of the government to maintain these relations, and to draw them
                    more closely together as they become developed by the increasing facilities of
                    communication between the two countries. I must express my personal
                    gratification in being allowed to perform this pleasant duty.</p>
            </div>
